"""Builds the new Story Ledger page: the black banner, then boxes side by side.

Run it from the project folder, AFTER unzipping starscapes-story-ledger-19oct.zip into it:   python3 tools/add-story-ledger-v2.py

What it does: it makes exact edits to three files that already exist: the Story Ledger page, its styles and its words.
  src/ledger/StoryLedgerPage.jsx, src/ledger/ledger.css, src/ledger/ledgerData.js

How it keeps you safe:
  - It checks ALL three files first. If any is not exactly the way it expects, it changes NOTHING and says which.
  - Before changing a file it keeps a copy, ending .before-story-ledger-v2.
  - It is safe to run twice: a file already done is left alone.
  - The new files () come in the zip itself.
"""
